---
title: Home Thermostat — A New Weekly Schedule & a Holiday Week
---
%% source: fictional example (smart thermostat app, two ways the weekly heating schedule changes)
%%{init: { 'sequence': { 'useMaxWidth': false, 'actorMargin': 150, 'width': 450, 'messageMargin': 45} } }%%
sequenceDiagram
    title Thermostat App: New Weekly Schedule & Holiday Week
    autonumber

    participant TH as Wall Thermostat
    participant APP as Phone App
    participant SCH as Schedule Cloud
    participant WX as Weather Feed
    participant TAR as Energy Price Feed
    participant HH as Householder

    Note over TH, APP: Opening the Schedule Screen

    alt Fresh Install, Nothing Set Up Yet
        HH->>APP: Opens the app for the first time

        par Fetch in parallel
            APP->>SCH: GET /schedule
            SCH-->>APP: Empty, no schedule yet

            APP->>TH: Read current room temperature
            TH-->>APP: 19.5 °C
        end
    else Holiday Week, Schedule Already Set Up
        HH->>APP: Taps "Away next week"
        APP->>SCH: GET /schedule
        SCH-->>APP: Weekday and weekend blocks

        par Fetch in parallel
            APP->>WX: GET /forecast?days=7
            WX-->>APP: Cold snap from Wednesday

            APP->>TAR: GET /prices?days=7
            TAR-->>APP: Half-hourly prices
        end
    end

    rect rgb(230, 244, 250)
        Note over APP, HH: Shaping the Week

        alt Fresh Install — Pick a Starting Template
            APP->>HH: Show three templates
            HH->>APP: Picks "Out at work, home evenings"

            alt Someone works from home on some days
                Note over APP: Ask which days, then copy the evening block to daytime
                par Fetch in parallel
                    APP->>WX: GET /forecast?days=7
                    WX-->>APP: Mild week

                    APP->>TAR: GET /prices?days=7
                    TAR-->>APP: Half-hourly prices
                end
            end

            Note over APP: Comfort 21 °C, Eco 17 °C, Night 16 °C
            Note right of APP: ✅ Night block always ends<br/>30 min before the first alarm.<br/>Taken from the phone's alarm clock.
            APP->>HH: Show the drafted week
        else Holiday Week — Keep the House Safe
            Note over APP: Every day becomes one Frost-Guard block (10 °C).
        end
    end

    rect rgb(250, 244, 228)
        Note over APP, TAR: Cheaper Hours

        APP->>TAR: Which hours are cheapest each day?

        alt Fresh Install — Shift Warm-Up into Cheap Hours
            TAR-->>APP: 05:00–06:30 cheapest most days

            par Work out the shift
                APP->>APP: Start the morning warm-up 40 min earlier
                Note right of APP: Only if the house holds heat well

                APP->>WX: Overnight lows for the week
                WX-->>APP: 3 °C to 7 °C
            end
        else Holiday Week — Pre-Heat Before Coming Home
            TAR-->>APP: Sunday 13:00–15:00 cheapest

            par Plan the return
                APP->>APP: Comfort block on Sunday from 14:00
                APP->>WX: Sunday afternoon temperature
                Note left of WX: Asked only for the return day
                WX-->>APP: 6 °C
            end
        end
    end

    rect rgb(238, 236, 250)
        Note over APP, SCH: Saving the Week
        Note right of APP: Both paths save the same way.

        opt IF the cold snap drops below 0 °C
            Note over APP: ⬇️ Raise Frost-Guard for those nights

            APP->>SCH: GET /schedule/frost-limits
            SCH-->>APP: Lowest allowed 10 °C, highest 14 °C

            APP->>HH: "Pipes may freeze. Raise to 12 °C on Wed–Thu nights?"
            Note over HH: Householder reads the warning
            Note right of HH: ⚠️ Only "Raise it" is offered<br/>while pipes are at risk
            HH->>APP: Raise it
        end

        APP->>SCH: PUT /schedule (the new week)
        SCH-->>APP: Saved

        APP->>TH: Send the new week

        alt Thermostat is offline
            TH-->>APP: 🟠 No reply after 30 s
            Note over APP: 🛑 Retry when the thermostat reconnects
        else Thermostat is online
            TH-->>APP: 🟢 Week stored on the device

            rect rgb(244, 244, 242)
                Note over APP, SCH: After Saving
                APP->>SCH: POST /history (old week kept for undo)
                Note right of SCH: One tap restores last week
                SCH-->>APP: Stored
            end

            TH->>TH: Show the next block on the dial
        end
    end
